-- The middle file of a chain of three: it imports
-- ok/section-given-import-operand-def.l4, uses a rule that reads that file's
-- section GIVEN as an operand, and has a section GIVEN of its own.
-- ok/section-given-import-operand-chain.l4 imports this one.

IMPORT `section-given-import-operand-def`

§ `Bonus`
    GIVEN bonus IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 4

GIVETH A NUMBER
`window plus bonus` MEANS `the window` PLUS bonus

GIVETH A NUMBER
`window and one` MEANS `the window` PLUS 1

#EVAL `window plus bonus`                           -- 34
#EVAL `window and one`                              -- 31
